#: .\opportunity\templates\opportunity\opportunity.html:66
msgid ""
"\n"
"\t\t\tWelcome to the Tenders Section of Turkmenistan. Here you will find "
"current tenders in Ashgabat and other regions of the country. We publish "
"information about public and private procurement, competitions, and bidding "
"to help businesses and entrepreneurs find profitable contracts. <br> <br>\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\tOur catalog of tenders in Turkmenistan is updated daily.<br> <br>\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\tLooking for tenders in Ashgabat? We have collected the latest offers "
"from government organizations, large corporations, and private companies. "
"Submit your application directly on the website and participate in the "
"competition.\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"\t\t\tTürkmenistanyň tenderler bölümini hoş geldiňiz. Bu ýerden siz "
"Aşgabadyň we ýurduň beýleki sebitleriniň häzirki tenderlerini taparsyňyz. "
"Biz döwlet we hususy satyn almalary, bäsleşikler we söwdalar baradaky "
"maglumatlary çap edýäris, bu bolsa kärhanalara we telekeçilere girdejili "
"şertnamalary tapmaga kömek edýär. <br> <br>\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\tTürkmenistandaky tenderler katalogymyz her gün täzelenýär. <br> <br>\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\tAşgabadyň tenderlerini gözleýärsiňizmi? Biz döwlet guramalaryndan, iri "
"korporasiýalardan we hususy kompaniýalardan iň soňky teklipleri jemledik. "
"Arzany göni web sahypasynda beriň we bäsleşige gatnaşyň."

