#: .\opportunity\templates\opportunity\vacancies.html:70
msgid ""
"\n"
"\t\t\tLooking for a job in Turkmenistan? This page features current job "
"vacancies in Ashgabat and other cities across the country. Here you’ll find "
"offers from government organizations, international companies, and private "
"employers in various fields—from IT and construction to trade, healthcare, "
"and education. <br> <br>\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\tWe update the list of job vacancies in Turkmenistan daily so you can "
"be among the first to discover new opportunities. <br> <br>\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\tIf you’re interested in jobs in Ashgabat, you’ll find everything from "
"entry-level positions for beginners to high-paying roles for experienced "
"professionals. We work directly with employers, ensuring up-to-date "
"information and a quick response to your application. <br> <br>\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\tStart your job search in Turkmenistan today—submit your CV and take "
"the first step toward a new career!\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"Türkmenistanda iş gözleýärsiňizmi? Bu sahypada Aşgabadyň we ýurduň beýleki "
"şäherleriniň häzirki iş orunlaryny taparsyňyz. Bu ýerde hökümet "
"guramalaryndan, halkara kompaniýalardan we hususy iş berijilerden dürli "
"ugurlardaky — IT, gurluşyk, söwda, saglygy goraýyş we bilim ýaly — teklipler "
"jemlenendir. <br><br>\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\tBiz Türkmenistandaky iş orunlarynyň sanawyny her gün täzeläp durýarys, "
"şonuň üçin täze mümkinçilikleri ilkinji bolup gözläp bilersiňiz. <br><br>\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\tAşgabadyň işlerine gyzyklanýan bolsaňyz, başlamak üçin amatly "
"başlangyç orunlaryndan başlap, tejribeli hünärmenler üçin ýokary tölegli "
"wezipelere çenli hemmesini taparsyňyz. Biz iş berijiler bilen gönüden-göni "
"işleýäris, bu hem maglumatlaryň häzirki wagtda bolmagyny we arzanyňyza çalt "
"jogap berilmegini üpjün edýär. <br><br>\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\tTürkmenistanda iş gözlegiňize häzirden başlaň — rezýumeňizi iberiň we "
"täze karýeranyň ilkinji ädimini ädiniň!"

